; Like beancount's lexer, every invalid token in a transaction is reported,
; not only the first: a one-letter metadata key (a:) and an invalid word,
; on whichever line of the dropped transaction they stand. The valid
; postings and metadata it drops report nothing, and the next transaction
; is kept.
2020-01-01 open Assets:A
2020-01-02 * "x"
  a: "x"
  b: "y"
  Assets:A  1 USD
    c: "z"
    ok: "valid"
  Assets:A  -1 USD
2020-01-03 * "y"
  Assets:A  1 USD
  Assets:A  -1 USD
2020-01-04 * "x"
  garbage
  Assets:A  1 USD
  garbage2
  Assets:A  -1 USD
2020-01-05 * "y"
  Assets:A  1 USD
  Assets:A  -1 USD
